rong> and <strong>OP (Production)</strong> URLs are provided to interact wi=
th the ThinQ server.</li><li>Different regions have specific URLs:<ul><li><=
strong>KIC</strong>: Asia</li><li><strong>EIC</strong>: Europe</li><li><str=
ong>AIC</strong>: North/South America</li></ul></li></ul><h3>API Methods:</=
h3><ol><li><p><strong>GET /devices</strong>: This retrieves a list of all d=
evices registered to the ThinQ server under the user's account. If your ser=
vice is restricted (e.g., only has permission to access refrigerators), it =
will only return devices of that type.</p></li><li><p><strong>GET /devices/=
profile/{device-id}</strong>: Fetches the profile of a specific device base=
d on its ID. The profile will contain detailed information about the device=
 depending on its type (refrigerator, washing machine, etc.).</p></li><li><=
p><strong>GET /devices/{device-id}</strong>: Retrieves the current status o=
f a specific device using its ID.</p></li><li><p><strong>POST /devices/{dev=
ice-id}</strong>: This method is used to control the device, potentially al=
lowing you to turn it on or off, adjust settings, etc.</p></li></ol><h3>Imp=
ortant Notes:</h3><ul><li>Before using the other methods (like retrieving a=
 device's status or controlling it), the first thing you should do is call =
<strong>GET /devices</strong> to retrieve the list of devices.</li><li>Each=
 device in the list has a unique <strong>device-id</strong> that you can us=
e to interact with specific devices using the other API methods.</li><li>On=
ce you've obtained the list of devices, you don't need to call this method =
repeatedly; you can use the list to target the specific devices you want to=
 interact with.</li></ul><h3>Access and Permissions:</h3><p>Your service mu=
st have permission to access certain device types. For example, if your ser=
vice is authorized only to interact with refrigerators, the list will only =
include refrigerators even if the user has other devices like washers or dr=
yers registered.</p><p>Let me know if you'd like further details or assista=
